<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Quantus ERP — Sistema de Gestión Empresarial & Punto de Venta | Chile</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Quantus ERP: Sistema de Gestión Empresarial todo en uno para pymes chilenas. Ventas, Inventario, Contabilidad SII, Compras, Tesorería y Agentes de Inteligencia Artificial.">
  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://www.quantuschile.cl/erp">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:site_name" content="Quantus Chile SpA">
  <meta property="og:title" content="Quantus ERP — Sistema de Gestión Empresarial">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Ventas, inventario, caja, compras y contabilidad SII en una sola plataforma integrada con Inteligencia Artificial.">
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://www.quantuschile.cl/erp">
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://www.quantuschile.cl/static/quantus-logo-clean.png">
  <meta property="og:locale" content="es_CL">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="{{ url_for('static', filename='quantus-logo-clean.png') }}">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-white: #ffffff;
      --bg-light: #f8fafc;
      --bg-subtle: #f1f5f9;
      --card-white: #ffffff;
      --border-light: #e2e8f0;
      --border-accent: #cbd5e1;
      --quantus-navy: #06101f;
      --quantus-navy-mid: #0b172a;
      --primary-cyan: #0284c7;
      --primary-blue: #2563eb;
      --cyan-bright: #38bdf8;
      --accent-emerald: #10b981;
      --accent-amber: #f59e0b;
      --text-main: #0f172a;
      --text-body: #334155;
      --text-muted: #64748b;
      --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
      --shadow-md: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
      --shadow-lg: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08), 0 8px 10px -6px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
      --shadow-xl: 0 20px 40px -15px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.12);
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg-white);
      color: var(--text-body);
      margin: 0;
      font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    /* TOP ELEGANT QUANTUS NAVY RIBBON */
    .top-ribbon-quantus {
      background: var(--quantus-navy);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2);
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 9px 0;
      font-size: 12.5px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .ribbon-flex {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .ribbon-left-brand {
      color: var(--cyan-bright);
      font-size: 11.5px;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 800;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .ribbon-right-group {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .ribbon-item {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      color: #e2e8f0;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    .ribbon-item:hover {
      color: var(--cyan-bright);
    }

    /* MAIN HEADER NAV WITH OFFICIAL QUANTUS CHILE SpA LOGO */
    .main-header {
      background: var(--bg-white);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
    }

    .header-shell {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      height: 76px;
    }

    /* Official Quantus Chile SpA Logo Branding */
    .brand-quantus-official {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .brand-symbol-img {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      object-fit: contain;
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    .brand-text-block {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .brand-name-quantus {
      font-size: 19px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--text-main);
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    .brand-name-accent {
      color: var(--primary-cyan);
    }

    .brand-tagline-quantus {
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .nav-links-menu {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 28px;
      list-style: none;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .nav-link-item {
      color: var(--text-main);
      font-size: 14.5px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    .nav-link-item:hover, .nav-link-item.active {
      color: var(--primary-cyan);
    }

    .header-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .btn-outline-login {
      padding: 10px 18px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--border-accent);
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--text-main);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .btn-outline-login:hover {
      border-color: var(--primary-cyan);
      color: var(--primary-cyan);
      background: rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.04);
    }

    .btn-cyan-quantus-cta {
      padding: 11px 22px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-cyan) 0%, var(--primary-blue) 100%);
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-decoration: none;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.3);
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .btn-cyan-quantus-cta:hover {
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.45);
    }

    /* CONTAINER SHELL */
    .container {
      width: min(calc(100% - 64px), 1280px);
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .section-padding {
      padding: 90px 0;
    }

    /* HERO SPLIT SECTION (White Premium) */
    .hero-section-white {
      padding: 70px 0 90px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #f8fafc 100%);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    }

    .hero-split-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.15fr;
      gap: 56px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .hero-kicker-pill {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      background: rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.2);
      color: var(--primary-cyan);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .hero-title-main {
      font-size: clamp(38px, 4.5vw, 56px);
      line-height: 1.1;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--text-main);
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      margin: 0 0 20px;
    }

    .hero-title-main .accent {
      color: var(--primary-cyan);
    }

    .hero-lead-paragraph {
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--text-body);
      margin: 0 0 28px;
    }

    /* Form Card White Premium */
    .form-card-white {
      background: var(--card-white);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 32px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl);
    }

    .form-head-title {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--text-main);
      margin: 0 0 6px;
    }

    .form-head-sub {
      font-size: 13.5px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin: 0 0 22px;
    }

    .form-grid-dual {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .form-input-white {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 13px 15px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--border-light);
      color: var(--text-main);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-family: inherit;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      outline: none;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .form-input-white:focus {
      border-color: var(--primary-cyan);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.12);
    }

    .btn-submit-cyan {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-cyan) 0%, var(--primary-blue) 100%);
      border: none;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 800;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.3);
      transition: all 0.2s;
      margin-top: 6px;
    }

    .btn-submit-cyan:hover {
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.45);
    }

    /* Laptop Screen Preview */
    .laptop-frame-white {
      background: #1e293b;
      border-radius: 18px 18px 4px 4px;
      padding: 10px 10px 0 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.25);
      border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
    }

    .screen-header-dark {
      background: #0f172a;
      border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .window-dots-flex {
      display: flex;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .dot-item {
      width: 10px;
      height: 10px;
      border-radius: 50%;
    }
    .dot-r { background: #ef4444; }
    .dot-y { background: #f59e0b; }
    .dot-g { background: #10b981; }

    .screen-url-box {
      background: #1e293b;
      color: #94a3b8;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 4px 14px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-family: monospace;
    }

    .screen-canvas-light {
      background: #f8fafc;
      border-radius: 0 0 10px 10px;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .laptop-preview-img {
      width: 100%;
      display: block;
      height: auto;
    }

    .dash-kpis-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .dash-card-light {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 14px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }

    .dash-card-label {
      font-size: 10.5px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .dash-card-val {
      font-size: 19px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--text-main);
    }

    .dash-card-tag {
      font-size: 10.5px;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-top: 3px;
    }
    .tag-green { color: #10b981; }
    .tag-amber { color: #f59e0b; }

    .dash-graph-box {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 16px;
    }

    .graph-bars-flex {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-end;
      gap: 10px;
      height: 80px;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .graph-bar-item {
      flex: 1;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--primary-cyan) 0%, rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.2) 100%);
      border-radius: 4px 4px 0 0;
    }

    .laptop-stand-base {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #94a3b8 0%, #64748b 100%);
      height: 12px;
      border-radius: 0 0 14px 14px;
      margin: 0 -18px;
    }

    /* SECTION TITLE BOX */
    .section-title-center {
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0 auto 56px;
    }

    .section-head-h2 {
      font-size: 36px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--text-main);
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .section-head-sub {
      font-size: 16px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* 8 CORE MODULES GRID */
    .modules-section-light {
      background: var(--bg-light);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    }

    .modules-grid-4col {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .module-card-white {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--border-light);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 28px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
      transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .module-card-white:hover {
      border-color: var(--primary-cyan);
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl);
    }

    .module-icon-circle {
      width: 50px;
      height: 50px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.2);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: var(--primary-cyan);
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .mod-card-h3 {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--text-main);
      margin: 0 0 8px;
    }

    .mod-card-p {
      font-size: 13.5px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.55;
      margin: 0 0 18px;
    }

    .mod-card-link {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--primary-cyan);
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    /* BANK LOGOS GRID */
    .bank-logos-section {
      background: var(--bg-white);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    }

    /* MOBILE APP & CLOUD BANNER SECTION */
    .mobile-app-banner-section {
      padding: 80px 0;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 100%);
      color: #ffffff;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .app-banner-card {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .app-banner-title {
      font-size: 34px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #ffffff;
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      line-height: 1.25;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .app-banner-sub {
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #94a3b8;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .app-features-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .app-feature-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #f8fafc;
    }

    .app-feature-icon {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.2);
      border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.4);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: #38bdf8;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .app-preview-visual {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 32px;
      text-align: center;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    }

    .bank-cards-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .bank-card-item {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--border-light);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 22px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      height: 64px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .bank-card-item:hover {
      border-color: var(--primary-cyan);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
      transform: scale(1.02);
    }

    .bank-text-brand {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .b-santander { color: #ec0000; }
    .b-chile { color: #0f265c; font-family: serif; font-weight: 900; }
    .b-estado { color: #e65100; }
    .b-bci { color: #008853; }
    .b-scotia { color: #ec111a; }
    .b-bice { color: #002d62; }
    .b-itau { color: #ec7000; }
    .b-security { color: #5a2a83; }

    /* FEATURE MATRIX */
    .matrix-section-light {
      background: var(--bg-light);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    }

    .matrix-box-white {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--border-light);
      border-radius: 20px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    }

    .matrix-row-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 2.2fr 1fr 1fr;
      padding: 16px 28px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
      align-items: center;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .matrix-row-grid:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    .matrix-head-row {
      background: #f1f5f9;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--primary-cyan);
      font-size: 12px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    }

    .tooltip-dot {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 16px;
      height: 16px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--primary-cyan);
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 900;
      margin-left: 6px;
      cursor: help;
    }

    .icon-check-green {
      color: var(--accent-emerald);
      width: 22px;
      height: 22px;
    }

    .icon-cross-gray {
      color: #94a3b8;
      width: 18px;
      height: 18px;
    }

    /* TESTIMONIALS SECTION */
    .testimonials-section {
      background: var(--bg-white);
    }

    .testimonials-grid-2col {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .testimonial-card-white {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--border-light);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 32px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    }

    .testi-user-flex {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .user-avatar-img {
      width: 54px;
      height: 54px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-cyan), var(--primary-blue));
      color: #ffffff;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 19px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .user-meta h4 {
      font-size: 17px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--text-main);
      margin: 0 0 2px;
    }

    .user-meta p {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin: 0;
    }

    .quote-paragraph {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.65;
      color: var(--text-body);
      font-style: italic;
      margin: 0;
    }

    /* RESPONSIVE */
    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      .hero-split-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .modules-grid-4col { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .bank-cards-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .testimonials-grid-2col { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .modules-grid-4col { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .bank-cards-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .form-grid-dual { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .nav-links-menu { display: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  {% include "partials/nav_header.html" %}

  <main>
    <!-- HERO SECTION (White Premium) -->
    <section class="hero-section-white">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="hero-split-grid">
          <!-- LEFT COLUMN: Value Proposition & Onboarding Form -->
          <div>
            <div class="hero-kicker-pill">
              Sistema ERP Institucional con Inteligencia Artificial
            </div>
            <h1 class="hero-title-main">
              El ERP de clase mundial que <span class="accent">hace crecer tu empresa</span> en Chile.
            </h1>
            <p class="hero-lead-paragraph">
              Integración total de Ventas, Inventario Multibodega, Facturación Electrónica SII, Compras y Tesorería en una plataforma amigable y de rápida implementación.
            </p>

            <!-- Registration Form Card -->
            <div class="form-card-white">
              <h3 class="form-head-title">Regístrate gratis en Quantus ERP</h3>
              <p class="form-head-sub">Gestiona tu negocio fácil y rápido. ¡Pruébalo gratis por 10 días! (No hace falta tarjeta de crédito)</p>
              <form action="mailto:contacto@quantuschile.cl" method="GET">
                <input type="hidden" name="subject" value="Registro Prueba Gratuita Quantus ERP">
